# USMAN MUSIC — Optional Build-Time Environment Variables
#
# No environment variables or API keys are required to build or run USMAN MUSIC.
# All entries below are intentionally commented out so builds and previews never
# block on missing secrets.

# LISTEN_TOGETHER_WS_URL (Optional, non-secret):
# Default WebSocket server URL baked into BuildConfig.LISTEN_TOGETHER_WS_URL.
# When unset, Listen Together uses the WebSocket URL saved inside the app under
# Listen Together -> Server Settings (gear icon) -> Save.
# You can also set this as a GitHub Actions secret for pre-configured APK builds.
# LISTEN_TOGETHER_WS_URL=wss://your-render-service.onrender.com/ws

# Legacy / Unused variables (not referenced by the current Android codebase):
# YOUTUBE_API_KEY=
# JAMENDO_CLIENT_ID=
